<title>USA: Pico Holdings Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Pico Holdings Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.72     loss	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net profit		21,765     loss	   749</p>
<p> Revs			49,239		    9,973</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,065		   26,876</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.90   profit	 $0.60</p>
<p> Net profit		24,320   profit	15,673</p>
<p> Revs			85,768		   47,945</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,124		   25,992</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 share values reflect November 20, 1996 reverse acquisition between Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio and Citation Insurance Group.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 revenues include $30.9 million in realized investment gains, primarily from investment in Fairfield Communities.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 revenues include net investment income $3.4 million.</p>
<p>1996 year revenues include net investment income of $42.4 million.</p>
<p>1995 year revenues include net investment income of $18.3 million.</p>
